APEX BROWSER — PHASE 4C

Universal DOM Scanner & Advanced Web Element Discovery Engine

PROJECT INFORMATION

Project: Apex Browser
Repository: https://github.com/alahmedali89/Apex-Browsers
Platform: Android
Language: Kotlin
UI: Jetpack Compose + Material 3
Web Rendering: Android WebView
Database: Room
Architecture: ViewModel + Repository

Apex Browser contains a deterministic, locally operating browser automation engine.

The objective is to make Apex capable of discovering and understanding a broad range of interactive website elements without depending on external AI APIs.

The browser must be able to inspect complex websites, identify form controls, understand their roles and properties, and make those elements available to the existing automation recorder, workflow editor, and replay engine.

